    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Maya S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117593585550952821360/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL9ulrUc7JmAgvmeDPT1l4u3orl7cUN8yzAE_ZRKSjfCSFFSA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t recommend this place enough! Our go-to for eggless cakes. My family has ordered from here a few times and the cakes are great. The last time we ordered, there was a small issue with the cake while the owner was out of town. We didn’t need a refund or anything since the cake was still edible but wanted to let them know what had happened. We had completely forgotten about the issue until a few weeks later when the owner personally came to our house and dropped off a new cake, free of charge! Service 10/10 and always well-decorated!",
        "time": 1763235951,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natalie Stait",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117896688387195030808/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUi88Bvy03JcO_3c-yEHAm_4wlwU-LEv62gotuUxtUpUnq145vM4g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great eggless cake! Sent a picture of an idea along with a description of what I'd imagine. Turned out exactly as I had wanted, and tasted amazing! It's hard to find bakeries that handle allergies, let alone having it taste  good, they obviously know their stuff! Thanks again!\n\n3 years later, and I continue to order custom cakes and am blown away each time!",
        "time": 1731191016,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "louise-andree Fontaine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109818598721096077754/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWXMsd0uGOs3_twN6RtGKcrQFzv5tgBbxfeIBfazbdJNGnMNXM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Cakes were very very fresh and the icing was perfect; not overly sweet! Our two birthday guests were very satisfied. I love the way the cakes were EXECUTED EXACTLY as we wanted them!! A thousand thank yous!",
        "time": 1721521821,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria Perreault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103952527177500338618/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSnR7WjprooTApPtKPYT-nYGH1UxSJ-dgxdnVTZUCA3mEDjQz7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Got my birthday cake here and it was so beautifully crafted! It tasted delicious, and the service was fantastic. I highly recommend this pastry shop 🩷",
        "time": 1705977223,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115530088715021903814/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_iQ65t9zw5oqC1gPJdCftLnMC1rfMNfaD3P8xgPSckp5845HZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I ordered a simple Black Forest cake on the same day, and they made it beautifully. The cake was delicious, not too sweet and perfect for the party size. I very strongly recommend this bakery!",
